Package: diagFDR
Title: Assessing False Discovery Rate Claims in Proteomics
Version: 0.2.1
Date: 2026-10-25
Authors@R: c(
    person("Quentin", "Giai Gianetto", email = "quentin.giaigianetto@pasteur.fr",
